--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Reproducing cfs_box.webp
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Derived from the original 784x540 RGBA PNG (509,311 bytes) in pull request #75:

    cwebp -q 68 -m 6 -alpha_q 60 -sharp_yuv -metadata none \
          cfs_box.png -o cfs_box.webp

17,766 bytes, visually indistinguishable at the size the card renders it. The
784px width is kept deliberately: the card draws the image at roughly 400-560
CSS pixels, so this is about 2x for high-DPI displays, and downscaling further
looked soft. Below roughly q60 the glass gradients start to band.

Re-encode from the original PNG, never from cfs_box.webp, or generation loss
compounds.
